    "sub_ename": "RF COMMUNICATION INTEGRATED CIRCUITS DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "提升本系大學生對目前工業界最重視之無線通訊積體電路之設計原理與方法，以及射頻電路實作技術介紹與訓練。",
    "describe_eh": "The theorem and design method of RF integrated circuit design for wireless communication application are very important for nowadays industry. This course will improve the capability of bachelor-degree students on this field.",
